  "notes": "Document Processing Bot (LLM Vision Edition)\n\n## Overview\nThis workflow automatically processes documents from your inbox using AI Vision (GPT-4o) to extract data without OCR templates.\n\n## Setup Instructions\n\n### 1. Configure Credentials\n- Gmail OAuth2 (for trigger, labeling, and alerts)\n- OpenAI API Key (must have GPT-4o access)\n- Google Sheets OAuth2\n- Google Drive OAuth2\n\n### 2. Update the 'Set Config' Node\n- rootFolderId: Your Google Drive folder ID\n- spreadsheetId: Your Google Sheets ID\n- sheetName: Name of the sheet tab (default: 'Document Log')\n- notificationEmail: Email for alerts\n- processedLabel: Gmail label name (default: 'DocBot/Processed')\n\n### 3. Prepare Google Sheet\nCreate columns: Processed Date, Document Type, Vendor Name, Document Number, Document Date, Due Date, Currency, Subtotal, Tax, Total, Confidence, Original Filename, New Filename, Email From, Email Subject, Needs Review, Warnings, Notes\n\n### 4. Create Gmail Label\nCreate a label called 'DocBot/Processed' in Gmail\n\n## Customizing Extracted Fields\nEdit the system prompt in the 'OpenAI Vision Extract' node to add or remove fields from the JSON schema."
